  "name": "Wuxia robe baseline",
  "notes": "Baseline adult body measurements for the cross-collar wuxia robe experiment. Documented assumptions: a 175 cm tall adult with a 100 cm chest, 84 cm waist and 98 cm hip. All values in millimetres. The robe is cut loose so it can be worn over an inner layer; the pattern adds its own ease on top of these numbers.",
